		{
			title: "Your Lights, Your Style"
			icon: "minecraft:glowstone_dust"
			x: 0.75d
			y: 1.75d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&eAs you can already see, Fairy Lights are fairly customizable to your design needs. But there's a few things you may like to know!"
				""
				"&eIf you combine a Fairy Light with a Gold Nugget and one or more Dyes, you'll get a Color Changing Fairy Light that will cycle through the different colors!"
				""
				"&eWant some extra sparkle? Then craft a Fairy Light with some Glowstone Dust to make it Twinkle!"
				""
				"&eAs for the hung up strings themselves, you can adjust how much slack there is. Right Click with some String to make it droop down more, or Right Click with a Stick to shorten the length."
				""
				"&eOh, and if you want to turn the Fairy Lights off or back on? Just Right Click them."
			]
			dependencies: ["584C2E55F0843EFA"]
			id: "2B7E4D4FFF718D85"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "1D8D52206EA7299E"
					type: "item"
					item: "minecraft:gold_nugget"
				}
				{
					id: "5AD73AB2F1601E9D"
