		}
		{
			title: "Quarky Tools"
			icon: "quark:slime_in_a_bucket"
			x: -4.25d
			y: -3.75d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&eThere's a bunch of tools that Quark gives you for your builds, or for finding certain things."
				""
				"&eThe Seed Pouch can hold stacks of seeds, and Right Clicking with it will plant a 3x3 area."
				""
				"&eNext are Item Pipes, which work a bit uniquely. Items get pulled into the Pipe via a Hopper or other mechanism. They will travel forward and downward preferably. You can 'disable' a pipe with a Redstone Signal. Pipes that split both left and right will split the items randomly."
				""
				"&eThe Trowel is a builder's friend. When you Right Click with it, it will place a random Block in your Hotbar."
				""
				"&eYou can get a Bucket of Slime by Right Clicking an Empty Bucket on a tiny Slime. If you enter a Slime Chunk, the Slime in the Bucket will bounce."
			]
			dependencies: ["4DC50AC316891B1D"]
			id: "5670599B6CB4A3A2"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "480C4F2D2CE177BF"
