		}
		{
			title: "More Quarky Tools"
			icon: "quark:abacus"
			x: -5.25d
			y: -3.75d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&eIf you take a Glass Bottle up high in the air, in the Cloud layer, and Right Click, you'll bottle some of the Clouds. You can then Right Click the Bottled Cloud anywhere to release it right in front of you, making a solid cloud that lasts for a few seconds. You can then Right Click another block onto it to replace it."
				""
				"&eRope Coils can be Right Clicked onto the bottom of a block, then lowered downward by Right Clicking more Rope onto it."
				""
				"&eThe Abacus can be Right Clicked on a block to mark it as the 'start'. Then you can aim towards another block. The Abacus will count how many blocks it takes to go to the block you are aiming at, using ONLY right angles. "
			]
			dependencies: ["5670599B6CB4A3A2"]
