		{
			title: "An Anchored Landing"
			icon: "travel_anchors:travel_anchor"
			x: -4.25d
			y: 2.75d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "MOD : Travel Anchors (@travel_anchors)"
			description: [
				"&eNow, I know many bases aren't vertical. Heck, here at the Business our buildings are all over the place!"
				""
				"&eThe Elevators research includes a... well, I guess you could say its an upgraded elevator!"
				""
				"&eIt's called a Travel Anchor! You can set a couple of these down, Right Click them to name them, and then you can stand on one, and see the others to jump to when you look at them!"
				""
				"&eThey can't be TOO far away, but a couple chunks should be no problem!"
				""
				"&eYou can also hold a Travel Staff and jump to nearby Travel Anchors in the same way!"
